# Ageha Editor
===
Markdown editor built using Tauri. It is lightweight and can be used without the need for installation.

### Core Features

- Real-time preview
- Printing (including PDF export)
- HTML export
- Input assistance
- Flowchart support (Mermaid)
- Mathematical formula support (KaTeX)
- Slide creation (Marp)
- Slideshow mode
- Vim mode
- Custom CSS
